## AI Optimizer starter environment file
## See docs/content/guides/env-vars.mdx for the complete AIO_* variable reference.
## Set the required CORE database values before starting the server directly.
## The local client setup page collects these values when they remain commented.

## Authentication
# AIO_API_KEY=

## CORE database (required)
# AIO_DB_USERNAME=
# AIO_DB_PASSWORD=
# AIO_DB_DSN=localhost:1521/FREEPDB1

## Common model providers
# AIO_OPENAI_API_KEY=
# AIO_ON_PREM_OLLAMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
